      "created_at": "2012-11-28T09:14:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah - if a card doesn't specify exactly where it needs to be played/used against (ie if it doesn't say \"Play next to the hero with the loest hp\" or whatever), you can choose the target. So Infection can be played against any hero. If you have Infernal Relics, Gloomweaver's voodoo pins are a different story.</p>",
